      "tests": [
        {
          "id": "mms_varcoeff_vertical_diffusion_noflux_decay",
          "description": "Manufactured solution u(z,t) = exp(-pi^2 t) cos(pi z) for u_t = d/dz(kz du/dz) + S with kz(z) = 0.5(1 + 4z(1-z)) on the quadratic-stretch vertical mesh. u*_z vanishes at both walls, so the physical flux matches the zero-flux closure exactly. The t = 0 assertion pins the ic wiring (reference equals the initial field); the t = 0.1 assertion bounds the L2 discretization error, which falls at the conservative-FV order 2 in both L2 and Linf. Exact per-resolution error values are pinned in tests/conformance/convergence/latlon3d_diffusion_vertical_noflux/golden/errors.json.",
